      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:6d7ce37d-04db-48cf-a4e0-23671cdcf812/be37a474-347b-42fb-8c7b-46aaace32930/16",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:6d7ce37d-04db-48cf-a4e0-23671cdcf812/be37a474-347b-42fb-8c7b-46aaace32930/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:6d7ce37d-04db-48cf-a4e0-23671cdcf812/be37a474-347b-42fb-8c7b-46aaace32930/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:6d7ce37d-04db-48cf-a4e0-23671cdcf812/be37a474-347b-42fb-8c7b-46aaace32930/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Thomas Bernhart",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A6d7ce37d-04db-48cf-a4e0-23671cdcf812",
      "timeZone": "Europe/Zurich"
     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8\" data-account-id=\"6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8\" accountid=\"6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Dan Field</a> I think there is a misunderstanding here: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo-exts/fcrepo-docker/blob/main/Dockerfile\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo-exts/fcrepo-docker/blob/main/Dockerfile</a>  already uses the tag <a href=\"https://hub.docker.com/layers/library/tomcat/9-jdk11-openjdk/images/sha256-5a5d1f2d1f71618995c96f55b3939773fa33700bc7601328032512a49e7dffee?context=explore\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">tomcat:9-jdk11-openjdk</a> as a base image. The problem is, that this tag has not been updated since 2 years.</p>\n\n<p>We should instead use <a href=\"https://hub.docker.com/layers/library/tomcat/9-jdk11/images/sha256-26d484513d2b80b3f1be2018769b8d2f9cba6069f3d41742f3311279a725dd3c?context=explore\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">9-jdk11</a> or on of the following if we want to be more specific on what JDK version is used:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>9.0.88-jdk11-temurin-jammy</li>\n\t<li>9.0-jdk11-temurin-jammy</li>\n\t<li>9-jdk11-temurin-jammy</li>\n\t<li>9.0.88-jdk11-temurin</li>\n\t<li>9.0-jdk11-temurin</li>\n\t<li>9-jdk11-temurin</li>\n</ul>\n",
     "created": "18/Apr/24 10:52 AM",
     "id": "23022",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/13841/comment/23022",
